{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24998","headline":"题陈侯竹亭 · 牟融","name":"题陈侯竹亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾向幽亭一榻分，清风满座绝尘氛。\n丹山凤泣钩帘听，沧海龙吟对酒闻。\n漠漠瞑阴笼砌月，盈盈寒翠动湘云。\n岁寒高节谁能识，独有王猷爱此君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}